{"c":[{"id":"278f6b06c3a7df2f","sum":"Windows: CRLF canonicalized on read; lock is naps/ flock, else a runtime-dir file (fcntl then msvcrt); msvcrt wait is 30s monotonic elapsed, waited += 0.01 is backoff only. Do not monkeypatch os.name to nt on Linux (WindowsPath crash).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T014746Z-2240e9a38cbd40b5","text":"Windows: CRLF canonicalize on read; lock is naps/ flock else runtime-dir file (fcntl then msvcrt); do not monkeypatch os.name to nt on Linux (pathlib WindowsPath crash).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T153140Z-a4f303a1f756c0ca","text":"msvcrt lock wait is 30s monotonic elapsed; waited += 0.01 is backoff only, not the deadline","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"2bc6b5f9386d965f","sum":"Bootstrap wake is python .summem/summem wake; Usage is bare on Unix, python-prefixed on Windows. msvcrt lock-deadline test allows 1e-9 slack on sum(sleeps): 3.12+ can land at 30.000000000000007.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260910T234518Z-6ee83d5cd5f8d318","text":"Bootstrap wake is python .summem/summem wake; Usage is bare on Unix, python-prefixed on Windows","type":"note"},{"name":"20260910T234852Z-a4967a2ed0a2a1f1","text":"msvcrt lock-deadline test must allow 1e-9 slack on sum(sleeps); 3.12+ can land at 30.000000000000007","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
